  "source_pdf": "downloads/pigsys-nine-little-cookies-v1.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "c7f0b73afcc13c5049bf127b9d3e3cc99e9d6b4b106ce3411f9434d0fdcd599a",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0288ca564db9d649fc6b34632ea54bf8b5ed6a75c5d5ef56d689d6eccd539a8a",
      "text": "Pigsy’s Nine\nLittle Cookies",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3223bb4be777864b40e431c08b768beda9cc3e0aa80d8562bc303bb884d3bff4",
      "text": "Pigsy bakes nine little cookies.\nOne, two, three, four, five,\nsix, seven, eight, nine!\nThey all look the same.\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d0c11ee7826dc2866907279a578fcd3cc7f7fde8a57c686c9da4e6c73b12d53f",
      "text": "Wukong and Rabbit come\nto visit.\nPigsy puts out three plates.\n“Let’s share!” he says.\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2e72dc694aa98e4ea9a2431ea7c570cc8a7be274b55c96104b30bd0917657110",
      "text": "“I can do it!” says Wukong.\nFour for Wukong.\nThree for Rabbit.\nTwo for Pigsy.\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "bad343379287e803be31bb3d91b1d1c329f99af6fa9bbc607aeaed3c9e962844",
      "text": "Pigsy looks at his plate.\n“My plate has so much room,”\nhe says.\n“My cookies look lonely!”\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0e96d979847c346ffd34ba40eb3920c4d3ecb74ad3e47c7da6af6adf1d5702c3",
      "text": "Rabbit counts each plate.\nFour, three, two.\n“That is not fair,” she says.\n“Let’s give each friend\nthe same.”\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9da30d7e54a2b246b5c055ad51f0292d6c53a1ad9ea36df3d7ba8bf67a1d948c",
      "text": "They put all the cookies back\non the tray.\nNine cookies again.\nNot one is lost.\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "11f4cd3ec0860bd28b5f95b44e7568d249645f0645c7063ad6924ae99aaf0d84",
      "text": "“Let’s share in turns,”\nsays Rabbit.\n“One for each plate,\nround and round.”\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8d8ad135f9cce6441336e5427989a9dd77d6b623fa98099b75ee27af03b35181",
      "text": "Round one:\none for Wukong,\none for Rabbit,\none for Pigsy.\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "685b8b36b0024552b6937bb532f0b56c9c0b57ea023e6f58f219a28e96572f40",
      "text": "Round two:\none, one, one.\nEach plate has two now.\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "933e2bd1f84c2bd2474bcbca120304cf9c6b482cdd5f54e1d78422de3e73c2cc",
      "text": "Round three:\none, one, one.\nThe tray is empty!\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "34a00b6fa0c19eff8e94ed0611581dcade5dc68d9d66cbfb0a7c61e4001be983",
      "text": "Everyone counts.\nThree, three, three!\n“Each friend has three,\nso it is equal and fair!”\nsays Rabbit.\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c125d24a4386e09fb44615361036c621af6b3204739a941a4ec7d7ade44f64d2",
      "text": "Pigsy turns the empty\ntray over.\n“I am looking for a fourth\nplate,” he says.\n“For my tummy!”\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "76cdd8b5c4a69f1a18538b0332f37583057c09b1c5d513cfcb156e0b8e610aaf",
      "text": "Rabbit giggles.\n“There is no fourth plate.\nThree plates are enough.”\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "91d4d1744c5c0790308af6b5b27e89096b52737290b1644f7b54ed6e24a97543",
      "text": "Now it is time to eat.\nCrunch, crunch, crunch!\nEveryone has an equal share.\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0b63f5b9f6b40324f85279fdea2e5bdf3ec4980d0c2e08133b67518906632798",
      "text": "Three empty plates sit in\na row.\nPigsy pats his round tummy.\n“Three was just right,”\nhe says.\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d22637ab6fc3dba430ef0766620f48df979b60ce1dd6eb422e5d1b92cb88016b",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
