      "sha256": "f3615e78fbe77314a3ff65eb0bcebdc98d38b844f8aca5fd7873a11e5d2aadba",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nOne for each plate,\nround and round.\nIs it fair now?\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends",
